    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.poster.avif?t=1755766746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.webm?t=1755766746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single\u2011player mode and co\u2011op</strong> for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric locales</strong>, from the snug kitchen\u2011berth to the abandoned sleeper car;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classical compositions</strong> immersing you in the cozy train\u2011compartment atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gripping story</strong> you can dive into solo or share with friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four close friends</strong>, each with a unique personality yet bound by unbreakable bonds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming visual style</strong> that invites you deeper into the mystery.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat\u2019s it like to leave your exams behind and head home? But what if \u2018home\u2019 holds more than just the path back?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.poster.avif?t=1755766746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846920/extras/5436fff5551926f9e317d1a4661970cb.webm?t=1755766746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a worrying phone call, you rush to board the train\u2014only to find that instead of the usual peaceful journey, subtle hints point to something hidden. <strong>Anomaly Express</strong> is a first\u2011person adventure game in which you\u2019ll explore silent compartments and moonlit corridors of a night train to uncover why you\u2019ve been drawn into this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single\u2011player mode and co\u2011op</strong> for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric locales</strong>, from the snug kitchen\u2011berth to the abandoned sleeper car;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classical compositions</strong> immersing you in the cozy train\u2011compartment atmosphere;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gripping story</strong> you can dive into solo or share with friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four close friends</strong>, each with a unique personality yet bound by unbreakable bonds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming visual style</strong> that invites you deeper into the mystery.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Exams over, you board the night train\u2026 everything feels ordinary until the steady rhythm of the wheels becomes the first page of a new story.",
